<p>Your body is used to pain. When you take a hit of 20% or more of your max life one of your inscriptions is taken off cooldown and infusion saturation is removed.</p><p>This effect has a cooldown of <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">30, 20, 15, 13, 12</acronym> turns.</p>